    "seoArticle": "\n      <p><strong>Courbevoie</strong> is home to most of the towers of La Défense, the leading business district in Europe, with more than 180,000 employees. L'Écrin Traiteur delivers breakfasts here from <strong>€8 excl. VAT per person</strong>, lunch trays from <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT</strong>, buffets and cocktail receptions from <strong>€29.90 excl. VAT</strong>, Monday to Friday, from <strong>6:30 am</strong>. Our kitchen is in Boulogne-Billancourt, in the Hauts-de-Seine like Courbevoie, and our rounds are planned to keep to tight time slots in the towers.</p>\n\n      <h2>Corporate lunch trays in Courbevoie</h2>\n      <p>For a working lunch without leaving the room, the individual lunch trays of the Essentiel collection start at <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT per person</strong> for vegetarian, €29.90 excl. VAT for chicken and €30.90 excl. VAT for fish: starter, main, dessert and bread, film-wrapped and labelled. For 15 people with chicken, allow €448.50 excl. VAT, or €477.50 excl. VAT with the €29 excl. VAT delivery. The menus are on the <a href=\"/creations/plateaux-repas\">lunch trays</a> page.</p>\n\n      <h2>Office breakfast in Courbevoie</h2>\n      <p>The Classique formula, at €8 excl. VAT per person, brings together butter pastries, juice, coffee and a basket of fresh fruit. The Complet formula adds madeleines or cakes and a wider choice of juices for executive committees and welcome events. A team of 10 people with Classique comes to €109 excl. VAT including delivery. The formulas are detailed on the <a href=\"/petit-dejeuner-entreprise/courbevoie\">office breakfast in Courbevoie</a> page. For large groups, the order is put together on a quote, with consistent quality across the whole delivery.</p>\n\n      <h2>Delivering to the towers: First, Total, CNIT, Quatre Temps</h2>\n      <p>Delivering to La Défense is a skill in itself: dedicated car parks, pedestrian access, building reception, goods lifts. Our orders are packed for the lift, in rigid crates, with hot coffee in flasks. We deliver to Tour First, Tour Total, the CNIT, Westfield Les Quatre Temps and the Groues district. When you order, give us the name of the tower, the floor, the contact on site and the time the room must be ready.</p>\n\n      <h2>Buffets and cocktail receptions in the towers of La Défense</h2>\n      <p>For end-of-project drinks, a convention or an afterwork, three formulas, drinks not included, with delivery at €29 excl. VAT per order on top:</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>L'Invitation, 8 canapés per person, €29.90 excl. VAT: €1,225 excl. VAT for 40 people, delivery included.</li>\n        <li>La Réception, 12 canapés, €40.90 excl. VAT: €1,665 excl. VAT for 40 people, delivery included.</li>\n        <li>La Célébration, 16 canapés, €51.90 excl. VAT: €2,105 excl. VAT for 40 people, delivery included.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Details are on the <a href=\"/creations/cocktails\">buffets and cocktail receptions</a> page and in the guide to the <a href=\"/journal/budget-cocktail-entreprise-paris\">budget for a corporate cocktail reception</a>.</p>\n\n      <h2>Example: an event for 100 people at La Défense</h2>\n      <p>At menu prices, an event for 100 people comes to: €800 excl. VAT for a Classique breakfast, €2,890 excl. VAT for vegetarian lunch trays and €4,090 excl. VAT for a La Réception cocktail reception, drinks not included, plus €29 excl. VAT delivery per order. At this size, 48 hours' notice is recommended, and the tailored quote, sent within 24 hours, specifies access to the tower, the loading bay or reception, and the time each service must be ready.</p>\n\n      <h2>Seminars and training days in a tower</h2>\n      <p>A full day can be ordered in one go: morning break, lunch trays at noon, afternoon break, with different products at each service. For the towers on the Puteaux side, see <a href=\"/traiteur/puteaux\">catering in Puteaux</a>, and for an overview of the district <a href=\"/traiteur/la-defense\">catering at La Défense</a>.</p>\n\n      <h2>Halal, pork-free, vegetarian</h2>\n      <p>Everything is halal and pork-free by default, alcohol-free, at no extra cost. Vegetarian, vegan and gluten-free options are specified when you order, with the number of people concerned. Our kitchen handles flour: traces of gluten remain possible.</p>\n\n      <h2>Ordering your catering in Courbevoie</h2>\n      <p>Order until <strong>2 pm</strong> the day before, delivery from 6:30 am. From 50 people, or for several towers, 48 hours' notice is recommended. €50 minimum order (excl. VAT), delivery €29 excl. VAT, no minimum number of guests. Company invoicing with VAT, purchase orders accepted. <a href=\"/devis\">Request your quote</a>, reply within 24 hours.</p>\n    "
