    "seoArticle": "\n      <p><strong>Puteaux</strong> covers a good part of La Défense, starting with the Ariane and Aurore towers, plus the buildings of the Bellini district and the offices along the Seine. On prices: breakfast from <strong>€8 excl. VAT per person</strong>, lunch trays from <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT</strong>, cocktail receptions from <strong>€29.90 excl. VAT</strong>, delivered Monday to Friday from <strong>6:30 am</strong>. This is an area where delivery depends as much on logistics as on what is on the tray: the wrong loading bay, a missing badge, and breakfast arrives after the meeting.</p>\n\n      <h2>Office breakfast in Puteaux and La Défense</h2>\n      <p>Orders here are often large: 30, 50, sometimes 80 people for a launch or an extended committee. We deliver platters of butter pastries, baskets of freshly cut fruit, Alain Milliat juices and coffee, in quantity, without the composition suffering as the numbers rise. With the Classique formula, at €8 excl. VAT per person, a team of 50 comes to €400 excl. VAT, or €429 excl. VAT with the €29 excl. VAT delivery. The formulas are detailed on the <a href=\"/petit-dejeuner-entreprise/puteaux\">office breakfast in Puteaux</a> page, and the full menu on <a href=\"/creations/petits-dejeuners-et-pauses\">breakfasts and breaks</a>.</p>\n\n      <h2>Delivering to a tower: what we handle for you</h2>\n      <p>Delivering to a tower is nothing like delivering to an ordinary office building. You need the right delivery access, often in the basement, a delivery slot, sometimes a visitor badge registered the day before. Our rounds cover the Ariane tower, the Aurore tower, Les Dunes, the Bellini district and the offices along the Seine, and we plan for these constraints from the moment you order.</p>\n      <p>What we ask of you so that delivery goes smoothly:</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>The exact name of the tower and the floor</li>\n        <li>The name and number of the contact on site</li>\n        <li>The delivery time you want, not the time of the meeting</li>\n        <li>The access procedure, if your site has one</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h2>Lunch trays for your meetings and training days</h2>\n      <p>At La Défense, the individual tray is the standard format for working lunches: everyone receives a complete tray, nobody gets up, the meeting carries on. Trays from the Essentiel collection start at <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT per person</strong> for vegetarian, €29.90 excl. VAT for chicken and €30.90 excl. VAT for fish, with starter, main, dessert and bread. For 20 people with vegetarian trays, that is €578 excl. VAT, or €607 excl. VAT with delivery. The menus are detailed on the <a href=\"/creations/plateaux-repas\">lunch trays</a> page.</p>\n\n      <h2>Which format for which meeting in Puteaux</h2>\n      <ul>\n        <li>A committee of 10 people at 9 am: a Classique or Complet breakfast, in place before 8:30 am.</li>\n        <li>A training day for 30 people: morning break, lunch trays at noon, afternoon break, all in a single order.</li>\n        <li>A launch or a convention for 80 people: a Complet breakfast, or a lunch reception of 12 canapés per person.</li>\n      </ul>\n\n      <h2>Cocktail receptions and afterworks at La Défense</h2>\n      <p>For a team afterwork or end-of-project drinks, we deliver at the end of the day formulas of 8, 12 or 16 canapés per person, at €29.90, €40.90 and €51.90 excl. VAT, drinks not included, ready to set out on the table. See the <a href=\"/occasions/afterwork-entreprise\">corporate afterwork catering</a> page.</p>\n\n      <h2>The whole menu is halal and pork-free</h2>\n      <p>By default, without you having to ask, and alcohol-free. For large teams like those at La Défense, this saves you from managing two separate orders. Vegetarian, vegan and gluten-free options on request, to be specified with the number of people concerned.</p>\n\n      <h2>Example: a convention for 60 people in Puteaux</h2>\n      <p>For a half-day convention, three starting budgets at menu prices, plus €29 excl. VAT delivery per order:</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Classique breakfast: €480 excl. VAT, or €509 excl. VAT with delivery.</li>\n        <li>Vegetarian lunch trays: €1,734 excl. VAT, or €1,763 excl. VAT with delivery.</li>\n        <li>La Réception lunch reception, 12 canapés: €2,454 excl. VAT, or €2,483 excl. VAT with delivery, drinks not included.</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>At this size, we recommend 48 hours' notice: the quote sets the quantities, the delivery slot and access to the tower.</p>\n\n      <h2>Ordering in Puteaux</h2>\n      <p>Order until <strong>2 pm</strong> the day before, delivery from 6:30 am. For 50 people or more, 48 hours' notice is recommended. €50 minimum order (excl. VAT), delivery €29 excl. VAT, no minimum number of guests. Company invoicing with VAT, purchase orders accepted, a dedicated contact for recurring accounts. <a href=\"/devis\">Request your quote</a>, reply within 24 hours.</p>\n      <p>For more on the logistics specific to the towers of La Défense, read our <a href=\"/journal/traiteur-puteaux-la-defense-guide-complet\">complete guide to catering in Puteaux &amp; La Défense</a>.</p>\n    "
