    "seoArticle": "\n      <p><strong>Versailles</strong> is not just a tourist town. It is an active economic hub of the Yvelines: firms, public services, service companies, educational institutions, plus the Satory business park and the nearby Saclay plateau. L'Écrin Traiteur delivers breakfasts here from <strong>€8 excl. VAT per person</strong>, lunch trays from <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT</strong> and cocktail buffets from <strong>€29.90 excl. VAT</strong>, Monday to Friday, from <strong>6:30 am</strong>. Our kitchen is in Boulogne-Billancourt: for Versailles, we set off earlier to keep to this time slot.</p>\n\n      <h2>Office breakfast in Versailles</h2>\n      <p>This is the most frequent order in the area, often for morning meetings or training days. The Classique formula, at €8 excl. VAT per person, includes two butter pastries from our partner bakers, an Alain Milliat juice, a coffee and a basket of freshly cut fruit. For 20 people, that is €160 excl. VAT before delivery. A fuller breakfast is quoted on request. The compositions are on the <a href=\"/creations/petits-dejeuners-et-pauses\">breakfasts and breaks</a> page, and the calculation by headcount in the <a href=\"/journal/budget-petit-dejeuner-equipe-personnes\">budget guide by number of people</a>.</p>\n\n      <h2>Delivery in Versailles: Notre-Dame, Saint-Louis, Montreuil, Satory</h2>\n      <p>We cover the whole town, from the Notre-Dame and Saint-Louis districts to the Montreuil district and the Satory area, as well as Le Chesnay-Rocquencourt, Parly 2, Viroflay and Jouy-en-Josas. Delivery from <strong>6:30 am</strong>, Monday to Friday. Give us the exact address, the floor, the name of the contact on site and the time the platter must be in place, not the time of the meeting. For Versailles, order the day before by 2 pm without exception: the journey is longer than for the 92 and we plan our rounds accordingly.</p>\n\n      <h2>Lunch trays and working lunches</h2>\n      <p>For working lunches, the individual lunch trays of the Essentiel collection start at <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT per person</strong> for vegetarian, €29.90 excl. VAT for chicken and €30.90 excl. VAT for fish: starter, main, dessert and bread, film-wrapped and labelled. For 10 people, allow €289 excl. VAT at the lowest, delivery not included. The menus and what they contain are on the <a href=\"/creations/plateaux-repas\">lunch trays</a> page.</p>\n\n      <h2>Buffets and cocktail receptions for events in Versailles</h2>\n      <p>For a seminar in Versailles, we handle both services in a single order: pastries and fruit for the morning break, chouquettes, cookies and madeleines for the afternoon one. For a reception, leaving drinks or a company buffet, our <a href=\"/creations/cocktails\">buffets and cocktail receptions</a> come in three formulas: L'Invitation (8 canapés per person, €29.90 excl. VAT), La Réception (12 canapés, €40.90 excl. VAT) and La Célébration (16 canapés, €51.90 excl. VAT), drinks not included. For 30 people with La Réception, the budget is €1,227 excl. VAT before delivery.</p>\n\n      <h2>Caterer across the Yvelines (78)</h2>\n      <p>Versailles is our base in the Yvelines, but we deliver more widely across the département: Le Chesnay-Rocquencourt, Viroflay, Jouy-en-Josas, and the Saint-Quentin-en-Yvelines area (Guyancourt, Élancourt, Montigny-le-Bretonneux, Maurepas). The same standards, the same artisans, the same lead times as in Versailles. For an address further away in the département, feasibility and the delivery charge are confirmed on the quote.</p>\n\n      <h2>How to choose a corporate caterer in Versailles</h2>\n      <p>Four points set apart the caterers who deliver in the Yvelines. Named artisans rather than anonymous products: pastries from partner bakers, Alain Milliat juices, platters assembled in the morning in our kitchen. Delivery by our own team, never subcontracted, so the time slot is kept. A priced quote within 24 hours, with delivery included in black and white. And a menu that suits the whole team without a separate order, since everything is halal and pork-free by default.</p>\n\n      <h2>A clear quote, with no surprise on the journey</h2>\n      <p>The prices per person shown on this page are menu prices, excluding VAT. The quote within 24 hours sets out the headcount, the products and the delivery, with no hidden line. €50 minimum order (excl. VAT), no minimum number of guests. The Yvelines are outside the €29 excl. VAT delivery flat rate that applies to Paris and nearby towns: delivery to Versailles is priced on the quote, according to the actual distance from our kitchen.</p>\n\n      <h2>The whole menu is halal and pork-free</h2>\n      <p>This is our standard across the whole menu, alcohol-free too and at no extra cost. Vegetarian, vegan and gluten-free options to be specified when you order, with the number of people concerned, with no extra line on the quote. Our kitchen handles flour: traces of gluten remain possible. The full offer is detailed on the <a href=\"/traiteur-halal\">halal corporate catering</a> page.</p>\n\n      <h2>Ordering in Versailles</h2>\n      <p>Order until <strong>2 pm</strong> the day before, delivery from 6:30 am, Monday to Friday. From 50 people, or for several sites, 48 hours' notice is recommended. The quote arrives within 24 hours, with company invoicing and VAT, purchase orders accepted. <a href=\"/devis\">Request your quote</a> giving the headcount, the date, the address in Versailles and any dietary requirements, or call 01 74 54 23 10.</p>\n    "
