    "seoArticle": "\n      <p><strong>Saint-Denis</strong> is buzzing economically. Between the development of the Pleyel district, the legacy of the 2024 Olympics and the arrival of new head offices, the town attracts companies looking for a reliable caterer. L'Écrin Traiteur delivers breakfasts here from <strong>€8 excl. VAT per person</strong>, lunch trays from <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT</strong> and cocktail buffets from <strong>€29.90 excl. VAT</strong>, Monday to Friday, from <strong>6:30 am</strong>, to the Stade de France, Pleyel, the town centre and the ZAC Landy France.</p>\n\n      <h2>Office breakfast in Saint-Denis</h2>\n      <p>Companies moving into the area need a supplier who keeps to the time and the quality from one delivery to the next. Our products are those of our menu, artisan-made and traceable: butter pastries, fresh fruit, pastries. With the Classique formula, at €8 excl. VAT per person (two pastries, an Alain Milliat juice, a coffee and a basket of fruit), a team of 15 people comes to €120 excl. VAT before delivery. The full breakfast is quoted on request. The menu is on the <a href=\"/creations/petits-dejeuners-et-pauses\">breakfasts and breaks</a> page.</p>\n\n      <h2>Lunch trays and working lunches</h2>\n      <p>The individual lunch trays of the Essentiel collection start at <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT per person</strong> for vegetarian, €29.90 excl. VAT for chicken and €30.90 excl. VAT for fish: starter, main, dessert and bread, film-wrapped and labelled, for your working lunches. For 12 people with chicken, allow €358.80 excl. VAT before delivery. See the <a href=\"/creations/plateaux-repas\">lunch trays</a> page.</p>\n\n      <h2>Buffets, cocktail receptions and corporate events</h2>\n      <p>For leaving drinks, a launch or a team event, our <a href=\"/creations/cocktails\">buffets and cocktail receptions</a> come in three formulas, drinks not included: L'Invitation at €29.90 excl. VAT per person (8 canapés), La Réception at €40.90 excl. VAT (12 canapés) and La Célébration at €51.90 excl. VAT (16 canapés). For 30 people with L'Invitation, the total is €897 excl. VAT before delivery. For a larger event, we also offer <a href=\"/creations/animations-culinaires\">live cooking stations</a>, prepared in front of your guests, on a quote.</p>\n\n      <h2>How much to order</h2>\n      <p>For a breakfast, allow two pastries per person, three for up to 10 people, and a hot drink. For a working lunch, one lunch tray per person, with a choice of vegetarian, chicken or fish. For a cocktail reception, 6 to 8 canapés per person for drinks, 12 to 14 for a lunch reception and 16 to 18 for a dinner reception, plus a 10% margin: the full calculation is in <a href=\"/journal/combien-pieces-cocktail-par-personne-entreprise\">how many canapés per person for a cocktail reception</a>. For an event linked to the Stade de France, we start from your actual headcount and the duration to price the quote.</p>\n\n      <h2>Delivery around the Stade de France and Pleyel</h2>\n      <p>We deliver to five areas: the Stade de France, Pleyel, the town centre, the ZAC Landy France and Porte de Paris. Access and times depend on the building, and around the Stade de France they may be restricted on some event days: when you order, give us the exact address, the floor, the contact on site and the access procedure. The district has its own page: <a href=\"/traiteur/saint-denis/pleyel\">corporate catering in Pleyel</a>.</p>\n\n      <h2>Corporate catering across the 93 (Seine-Saint-Denis)</h2>\n      <p>Saint-Denis is our base in Seine-Saint-Denis, but we deliver more widely across the département: Aubervilliers, Saint-Ouen-sur-Seine, Épinay-sur-Seine and the neighbouring towns. The same standards, the same artisans, the same lead times as in Saint-Denis. The €29 excl. VAT delivery flat rate applies to Paris and nearby towns; for Saint-Denis and the rest of the 93, delivery is shown on the quote according to the address.</p>\n\n      <h2>The whole menu is halal and pork-free</h2>\n      <p>This is our standard, not an extra-cost option, and alcohol-free. Vegetarian, vegan and gluten-free options to be specified when you order, with the number of people concerned. Our kitchen handles flour: traces of gluten remain possible.</p>\n\n      <h2>Ordering your catering in Saint-Denis</h2>\n      <p>Order until <strong>2 pm</strong> the day before, delivery from 6:30 am, Monday to Friday. €50 minimum order (excl. VAT), no minimum number of guests. From 50 people, or for an event linked to the Stade de France, 48 hours' notice is recommended and the quote is tailored: it details the quantities, the products and the delivery. Company invoicing with VAT, purchase orders accepted. <a href=\"/devis\">Request your quote</a>, reply within 24 hours.</p>\n    ",
