        "seoArticle": "\n          <p>The <strong>6th arrondissement of Paris</strong> embodies a certain idea of French excellence: historic publishing houses on boulevard Saint-Germain, business law firms on rue de l'Université, discreet head offices of luxury houses around Saint-Sulpice. L'Écrin Traiteur delivers breakfasts here from <strong>€8 per person excl. VAT</strong>, lunch trays from <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT</strong> and cocktail receptions from <strong>€29.90 excl. VAT</strong>, Monday to Friday, from <strong>6:30 am</strong>, with the same approach throughout: products whose maker we know.</p>\n          <h2>Caterer in Saint-Germain, at the heart of Paris publishing, law and luxury</h2>\n          <p>Morning meetings in the 6th bring together people who know the difference between an industrial croissant and an artisan pastry. Our <strong>Mado Paris madeleines</strong>, our <strong>Pierre Morel macarons</strong> and our <strong>butter pastries</strong> belong to the culture of genuine excellence that defines the 6th. These are not anonymous products; they come from named makers.</p>\n          <h2>Office breakfast in the 6th: options and prices</h2>\n          <p>The Classique breakfast, at €8 per person excl. VAT, includes two butter pastries, an Alain Milliat juice, a coffee and a basket of fresh fruit. For an editorial committee of 8 people, that comes to €64 excl. VAT, or €93 excl. VAT with the €29 excl. VAT delivery. The full breakfast, on quote, adds madeleines or cakes, fruit skewers, tea and a wider choice of juices: it suits welcoming an author, a client or a partner. All the options are on the <a href=\"/creations/petits-dejeuners-et-pauses\">breakfasts and breaks</a> page.</p>\n          <h2>Lunch trays for management lunches and meetings that run over</h2>\n          <p>When the committee runs into lunch, the individual lunch trays of the Essentiel collection avoid interrupting the session: €28.90 per person excl. VAT for vegetarian, €29.90 excl. VAT for chicken, €30.90 excl. VAT for fish, with starter, main, dessert and bread, film-wrapped and labelled. For 6 people with chicken, allow €179.40 excl. VAT, or €208.40 excl. VAT with delivery. The menus are on the <a href=\"/creations/plateaux-repas\">lunch trays</a> page.</p>\n          <h2>Breakfast delivery in Paris 6th, Haussmann buildings and inner courtyards</h2>\n          <p>The 6th arrondissement is mostly made up of Haussmann buildings and hôtels particuliers with distinctive access. Our delivery team respects the setting and the calm of these addresses, from Saint-Germain-des-Prés to Odéon and around the Luxembourg. So that delivery goes through without a call to your reception, give us the door code or the name on the intercom, the floor, whether there is a lift and the contact on site when you order. Discreet, punctual delivery, with no disruption to your work.</p>\n          <h2>Cocktail receptions, signings and farewells in the 6th</h2>\n          <p>For a launch, a signing or a leaving party, three options, drinks not included: €29.90 per person excl. VAT for 8 canapés (L'Invitation), €40.90 excl. VAT for 12 canapés (La Réception) and €51.90 excl. VAT for 16 canapés (La Célébration). For 20 people with La Réception, the total is €847 excl. VAT including delivery. Set the time slot when you order: for a meeting at 9 am, delivery around 8:30 am leaves time to set out the platters. See the <a href=\"/creations/cocktails\">corporate cocktail reception</a> page.</p>\n          <h2>Thanking an author, a client, a partner</h2>\n          <p>To mark a signing, a departure or the end of a collaboration, our boxes of exceptional madeleines are delivered on site: €24.90 excl. VAT for 10, €49.00 excl. VAT for 20 and €119.00 excl. VAT for 50. They can be personalised in your company's colours and delivered to one site or to several addresses. See the <a href=\"/creations/coffrets-cadeaux\">gift boxes</a> page.</p>\n          <h2>Editorial committees, management meetings, institutional client visits</h2>\n          <p>Whether you are organising an editorial committee, a partnership meeting or a client visit at your offices in Saint-Germain, L'Écrin Traiteur offers the right service. Order until <strong>2 pm</strong> the day before. For a same-morning request, call us: we do our best depending on availability. €50 minimum order (excl. VAT), no minimum number of guests. Company invoicing with VAT, purchase orders accepted. <a href=\"/devis\">Request your quote</a>, reply within 24 hours.</p>\n          <h2>Neighbouring arrondissements</h2>\n          <p>We deliver in the same way to the <a href=\"/traiteur/paris/7e-arrondissement\">7th</a>, the <a href=\"/traiteur/paris/14e-arrondissement\">14th</a> and the <a href=\"/traiteur/paris/15e-arrondissement\">15th</a>, as well as to <a href=\"/traiteur/paris\">every arrondissement of Paris</a>. Our savoury dishes are halal and pork-free by default, everything is alcohol-free, with vegetarian, vegan and gluten-free options to specify when you order.</p>\n        "
