        "seoArticle": "\n          <p>The <strong>12th arrondissement of Paris</strong> is an often underestimated business hub. The Bercy district is home to the Ministry of the Economy and Finance, one of the largest employers in the capital, as well as a dense mix of private companies, regional head offices and modern coworking spaces. L'Écrin Traiteur delivers here from 6:30 am.</p>\n          <h2>Caterer at Bercy: the ministry, companies and office head offices</h2>\n          <p>Bercy brings together very different profiles: Ministry of Finance staff, teams from companies based around Bercy-Village, regional head offices near the Gare de Lyon. Our artisan breakfasts suit all these settings, from an institutional meeting to a start-up onboarding, with the same freshness and the same quality.</p>\n          <h2>Breakfast delivery in Paris 12th: Gare de Lyon, Daumesnil, Nation</h2>\n          <p>We deliver across the whole of the 12th: the towers of Bercy-Village, the office buildings around the Gare de Lyon, the coworking spaces of Daumesnil and the offices near Nation. Time slots from 6:30 am to 10 am, guaranteed punctuality.</p>\n          <h2>Caterer in eastern Paris, for morning meetings and partner visits</h2>\n          <p>Whether you are organising an early executive committee, a meeting with partners or a training day in the 12th, L'Écrin Traiteur offers the right service. Order before <strong>2 pm the day before</strong> for the full catalogue. For a same-morning request, call us: we do our best depending on availability.</p>\n        "
