        "seoArticle": "\n          <p>The <strong>13th arrondissement of Paris</strong> is one of the major urban projects in Paris of the last twenty years. The <strong>Paris Rive Gauche</strong> district has turned former railway land into a modern business hub that attracts large companies, deeptech start-ups and leading academic institutions. L'Écrin Traiteur delivers here every morning.</p>\n          <h2>Caterer in Paris Rive Gauche, supporting innovation and growth</h2>\n          <p>The companies of Paris Rive Gauche often share values of innovation and commitment. Our artisan products fit naturally here: <strong>Mado Paris madeleines</strong>, known as the best in Paris, products without palm oil, full traceability of our makers. Ordering from L'Écrin Traiteur is also consistent with your organisation's CSR values.</p>\n          <h2>Breakfast delivery in Paris 13th: BNF, Tolbiac, Austerlitz, up to the Ivry border</h2>\n          <p>We deliver throughout the 13th arrondissement: the office towers of Paris Rive Gauche, the office buildings around Austerlitz, the coworking spaces of Tolbiac and the campuses in the area. Every delivery is handled with the same care, whether it is a 25-storey tower or a converted loft.</p>\n          <h2>Start-ups, large groups and academic institutes: a caterer for all</h2>\n          <p>The variety of businesses in the 13th is one of its strengths. L'Écrin Traiteur adapts to every profile: a tray of pastries for 6 people or a service for 80 colleagues. Order before <strong>2 pm the day before</strong>, or call us for a same-morning request.</p>\n        "
