        "seoArticle": "\n          <p>The <strong>14th arrondissement of Paris</strong> is built around two complementary forces: the office power of <strong>Montparnasse</strong>, with its landmark tower and office buildings, and the dense network of SMEs, firms and independent professionals that stretches towards Alésia and Denfert-Rochereau. L'Écrin Traiteur delivers across the 14th from <strong>6:30 am</strong>, Monday to Friday: breakfasts from <strong>€8 per person excl. VAT</strong>, lunch trays from <strong>€28.90 excl. VAT</strong>, cocktail receptions from <strong>€29.90 excl. VAT</strong>.</p>\n          <h2>Caterer at the Tour Montparnasse, delivery inside the office complex</h2>\n          <p>The Tour Montparnasse and its satellite buildings house hundreds of companies spread over dozens of floors. Our delivery team knows the access points, delivery procedures and contacts of the complex. Your breakfast arrives on the agreed floor, at the exact time requested, without you having to manage the logistics.</p>\n          <h2>Catering delivery in Paris 14th: Alésia, Denfert, Gaîté, Pernety</h2>\n          <p>Beyond the Tour Montparnasse, the 14th has a varied economic fabric: architecture firms, consulting agencies, independent professionals, service SMEs. Our delivery slots cover the whole arrondissement from 6:30 am to 10 am, with the same punctuality from the Carrefour Pernety to place Denfert-Rochereau.</p>\n          <h2>Which time slot to ask for in the 14th</h2>\n          <p>Our time slots cover the arrondissement from 6:30 am to 10 am. Choose the time the tray should be set down, not the time of the meeting: for a committee at 9 am, delivery at 8:15 am leaves time to set up the room; to welcome partners before 8 am, ask for 7:30 am. The earliest slots, from 6:30 am, suit teams that start early at the Tour Montparnasse or firms that receive visitors as soon as they open.</p>\n          <h2>Office breakfast in the 14th, for every occasion</h2>\n          <p>From your team's weekly breakfast to welcoming an important partner, L'Écrin Traiteur offers the service that suits your context and your budget. The Classique breakfast is €8 per person excl. VAT: for 12 people, €96 excl. VAT, or €125 excl. VAT with the €29 excl. VAT delivery. The full breakfast is quoted on request. The options are on the <a href=\"/creations/petits-dejeuners-et-pauses\">breakfasts and breaks</a> page.</p>\n          <h2>Lunch trays for the firms, agencies and SMEs of the 14th</h2>\n          <p>The individual lunch trays of the Essentiel collection start at <strong>€28.90 per person excl. VAT</strong> for vegetarian, €29.90 excl. VAT for chicken and €30.90 excl. VAT for fish: starter, main, dessert and bread, film-wrapped and labelled. For 6 people with the vegetarian tray, allow €173.40 excl. VAT, or €202.40 excl. VAT with delivery. There is no minimum number of guests: a four-person firm is delivered just like a large team. See the <a href=\"/creations/plateaux-repas\">lunch trays</a> page.</p>\n          <h2>Training day or seminar in the 14th: a whole day in one order</h2>\n          <p>A training day needs three moments: the morning break, lunch trays at midday and the afternoon break. For 15 people, allow €120 excl. VAT for the Classique breakfast in the morning, €433.50 excl. VAT for vegetarian lunch trays and €90 excl. VAT for the afternoon break, from €6 per person excl. VAT, making €643.50 excl. VAT, plus €29 excl. VAT delivery per order. See <a href=\"/occasions/journee-formation\">catering for a training day</a>.</p>\n          <h2>Buffets and cocktail receptions in the 14th</h2>\n          <p>For an opening, a farewell or an end-of-quarter meeting, three options, drinks not included, at €29.90, €40.90 and €51.90 per person excl. VAT for 8, 12 and 16 canapés respectively. For 30 people, that comes to €897, €1,227 or €1,557 excl. VAT, plus €29 excl. VAT for delivery. See <a href=\"/creations/cocktails\">buffets and cocktail receptions</a>.</p>\n          <h2>Dietary requirements and allergies</h2>\n          <p>Our savoury dishes are halal and pork-free by default, everything is alcohol-free, at no extra cost. For vegetarian, vegan or gluten-free options, tell us how many guests are concerned when you order: the trays are adapted without an extra line on the quote. The allergen list is available on request at commercial@lecrin-traiteur.fr, and our kitchen handles flour: traces of gluten are possible.</p>\n          <h2>Ordering in the 14th</h2>\n          <p>Order until <strong>2 pm</strong> the day before for the full selection. For a same-morning request, call us: we do our best depending on availability. €50 minimum order (excl. VAT), company invoicing with VAT, purchase orders accepted. <a href=\"/devis\">Request your quote</a>, reply within 24 hours. We also deliver to the <a href=\"/traiteur/paris/15e-arrondissement\">15th</a>, <a href=\"/traiteur/paris/13e-arrondissement\">13th</a> and <a href=\"/traiteur/paris/6e-arrondissement\">6th arrondissements</a>.</p>\n        "
